================================================================================
Demonstration data
================================================================================

"Meridian Wealth" is a fictional firm. All brokerage figures, holdings, and
transactions are fixture data flowing through a real protocol path. No market
data, real accounts, or real orders are involved. Credentials committed to
this repository are development defaults for a self-contained local lab, not
secrets.
